s:
To find $g(3)$, substitute $3$ into the function:
\[
g(3) = \dfrac{3^2 + 3 + 1}{5(3) - 3}
= \dfrac{9 + 3 + 1}{15 - 3}
= \dfrac{13}{12}
\]
The solution process is valid, and $\boxed{\dfrac{13}{12}}$ is the exact value.

